OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FStaying dry
OL,6,Fwith clear spells overnight, though
OL,7,Fmore cloud in the north or west at
OL,8,Ftimes. Winds easing to become light
OL,9,Finland, but remaining breezy near the
OL,10,Fnorth Kent coast.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FBright and dry through the
OL,13,Fmorning, more cloud developing during
OL,14,Fthe afternoon with isolated showers
OL,15,Fpossible in the far east, elsewhere
OL,16,Fshould remain dry. Moderate westerly
OL,17,Fbreeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
