OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FA
OL,6,Fchangeable period, with nearer-normal
OL,7,Ftemperatures than of late. Often fine,
OL,8,Fespecially on Friday. Breezy at times,
OL,9,Fwith rain most likely on Thursday
OL,10,Fmorning and Saturday.
